    # State Pension Credit Act 2002

    **External reference: work-level metadata and links only.**

    [Open the official contents](https://www.legislation.gov.uk/ukpga/2002/16/contents). The official work identifier is `https://www.legislation.gov.uk/id/ukpga/2002/16`.

    The title and identity were verified in the [pinned UK Legislation catalogue shard](https://github.com/chris-page-gov/okf-uk-legislation/blob/3fd2700f275fff53d8605f38eb3257780ea591fa/bundle/data/works-115.json.gz). Its 11 July 2026 snapshot records a version dated 1 April 2026. This dated catalogue entry is not a check of the law on 15 September 2026.

    No provision text, commencement analysis or amendment reconciliation has been acquired for this record. The related capital review remains a project-authored candidate: an exact statutory provision match and its applicability need source acquisition and specialist review.

    This reference preserves the distinction between the Act, DWP guidance and project interpretation. Its navigation relationships do not assert that any proposed rule correctly implements the Act.

