    # The State Pension Credit Regulations 2002

    **External reference: work-level metadata and links only.**

    [Open the official contents](https://www.legislation.gov.uk/uksi/2002/1792/contents). The official work identifier is `https://www.legislation.gov.uk/id/uksi/2002/1792`.

    The title and identity were verified in the [pinned UK Legislation catalogue shard](https://github.com/chris-page-gov/okf-uk-legislation/blob/3fd2700f275fff53d8605f38eb3257780ea591fa/bundle/data/works-114.json.gz). Its 11 July 2026 snapshot records a version dated 6 April 2026. This dated catalogue entry is not a check of the law on 15 September 2026.

    No regulation or schedule text has been acquired for this record. Exact DWP footnote-to-provision matching, conditions, exceptions, dates, extent and unapplied effects remain to be checked. The capital-disregards link is project-authored navigation, not an approved interpretation of a particular provision.

    The sibling's frozen official-effects datapack contains no assertion involving these Regulations. A new, bounded acquisition is needed before the exemplar can show an evidenced amendment chain for them.

